<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>寒热 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%AF%92%E7%83%AD/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2026 13:38:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%AF%92%E7%83%AD/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>九论寒热</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-22-jiulunhanre/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2026 13:35:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-22-jiulunhanre/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/">卷五书集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》附篇“九论寒热”，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;论述无外邪而身发寒热的内伤机理，&lt;strong&gt;张仲景真人&lt;/strong&gt;补充方药。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;身发寒热，半由外邪，亦有全无外邪者。此乃肝气郁结，致心、胆、脾、胃、肺诸经皆郁，气机不畅而作寒作热。不可妄用祛邪，当舒其木气，寒热自除&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>寒热第七十</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-70/</link><pubDate>Mon, 29 Sep 2025 18:45:11 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-70/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%81%B5%E6%9E%A2/">灵枢</category><description>寒热，指寒热毒气及由此形成的发冷发热的表现。本篇主要论述瘰疬的病因、病机和预后等。因瘰疬的形成主要是由于寒热毒气稽留于经脉之间造成的，所以篇名为&amp;quot;寒热&amp;quot;。</description></item></channel></rss>